1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,900
Assalamualaikum wa rahmatullahi
wa barakatuh.

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:09,340
Hi, I'm Awaiz Ahmed, a software engineer
and co-founder of Team Limitless.

3
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:12,600
Our project, BeBTR, is an award-winning
AI fitness application,

4
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:16,700
developed for the Smart Health Hackathon
powered by startAD

5
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:21,060
and the Department of Health – Abu Dhabi,

6
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:23,100
where we won First Place.

7
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:26,440
Today, millions of people exercise
without proper feedback.

8
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:31,640
They may perform movements incorrectly,
build unsafe habits,

9
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:35,100
or only realise something is wrong
after pain or injury appears.

10
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:39,300
BeBTR asks a foresight question:

11
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:45,600
What if the gym of the future could
prevent injury before it happens?

12
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,700
BeBTR uses AI, computer vision, and
wearable-data concepts

13
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:54,900
to give real-time posture correction
and adaptive training feedback.

14
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:57,720
Instead of generic workout advice,

15
00:00:57,720 --> 00:01:01,500
BeBTR helps users understand how they move,
and correct mistakes instantly,

16
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:04,300
and train in a safer,
more personalised way.

17
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:09,900
It is designed for a future where gyms,
schools, workplaces,

18
00:01:09,900 --> 00:01:14,700
and community wellness spaces can offer
intelligent preventive coaching to everyone.

19
00:01:14,700 --> 00:01:16,520
Over the next 10 years,

20
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:22,700
BeBTR can help shift fitness from reactive
treatment to proactive prevention.

21
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:26,700
This means fewer preventable injuries,
safer exercise habits,

22
00:01:26,700 --> 00:01:29,860
and better access to guidance for people
who cannot always afford

23
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:32,700
a personal trainer
or specialist support.

24
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:35,500
Our vision is not only to build an app,

25
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:39,500
but to help shape a future where everyday
movement becomes smarter, safer,

26
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:41,820
and more human-centred.

27
00:01:41,820 --> 00:01:47,500
BeBTR shows how foresight, AI, and
human-centred design can come together

28
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:49,900
to improve wellbeing
before problems begin.

29
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:52,500
We are Team Limitless,
and our mission is simple:

30
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:54,900
help people move better, train safer,
and build a healthier future.
